{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05822","headline":"奉和圣制送不蒙都护兼鸿胪卿归安西应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制送不蒙都护兼鸿胪卿归安西应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上卿增命服，都护扬归斾。\n杂虏尽朝周，诸胡皆自郐。\n鸣笳瀚海曲，按节阳关外。\n落日下河源，寒山静秋塞。\n万方氛祲息，六合乾坤大。\n无战是天心，天心同覆载。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}